#
# For Agnes API (break reminder feature):
# Set Base URL in Settings to: https://apihub.agnes-ai.com/v1
# Text model: Agnes-2.0-Flash (or other OpenAI-compatible chat model)
# Image model: agnes-image-2.1-flash (default)
